# raw/ is a VERBATIM CACHE OF OTHER PEOPLE'S DATA — ~14 MB of tarkov.dev, the
# wiki, tarkov-data-overlay and SPT, kept byte-for-byte so provenance is never in
# doubt. It is deliberately NOT committed:
#
#   - committing it would redistribute four projects' data under licences that
#     are theirs to set, not ours;
#   - it is a snapshot, so it is wrong the moment upstream changes, and a stale
#     mirror in a public repo is worse than no mirror;
#   - `node fetch/fetch_all.js` rebuilds it in about a minute.
#
# raw/MANIFEST.json is the exception and IS committed: it is our own record of
# what was fetched, from where, when, and how big — provenance without
# redistribution.
raw/*
!raw/MANIFEST.json
!raw/SUMMARY.md

node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
